   "szText": "{if:SF_26}{c_label}Spirit Cost: {/c}{c_resource}{Resource Cost}{/c}\r\n{/if}{c_label}Generate Spirit:{/c_label} {c_resource}{SF_5}{/c_resource}\r\n{if:ADVANCED_TOOLTIP}{c_label}Lucky Hit Chance: {/c}{c_resource}[{Combat Effect Chance}|%|]{/c}\r\n{/if}Sunder the earth, impaling all enemies hit for {c_number}{payload:DAMAGE}{/c} damage.",
